    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "Francis tasks:\n\nFrancis is the front end sales man. His tasks include the following:\n\n1) Customer makes contact with Francis - all information delivered to the customer happens from Francis \n2) Francis hands off information to Nikita and Kesha in real time, this includes intent, requirement, GST number and verification, and also CONSENT\n3) Francis receives usable information from Kesha and Nikita in the form of value adds to the customer, such as a request for more documents, a request for more information to understand the kind of requirement to tailor the solution as best as possible, to offer a report or a path forward towards that debt\n4) Francis writes into a DB, Nikita and Kesha can only read that DB. It is the source of truth for the state, and for basic information (PAN AADHAR GST CONSENTS STATE)\n5) Nikita and Kesha are writing into their own DB, able to read data from Francis (never accessing PII) They produce documents and information for Francis to communicate to the customer AND formatted documents to be sent to banks and NBFCs\n6) THIS INFORMATION NEEDS TO BE TRACKED SO THAT ALL HAVE ACCESS TO IT ( SENT TO BANK, AWAITING RESPONSE, CONFIRMED, DISBURSED, DOCUMENTS PENDING ETC) ",
        "height": 752,
        "width": 752,
        "color": 4
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        2848,
        2448
      ],
      "id": "26095f5e-c492-4327-8b57-1fd04b49c27e",
      "name": "Sticky Note11"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "NIKITA TASKS\n\n1) A document person. This means running GST information, running verification, running all calls that need to be made to turn the GST + PAN + Aadhar into actual CAM will be the main task on the ingestion end - making them available to Kesha on one side and Francis on another is the data sharing part of the task. \n2) Nikita will also be responsible for document preparation on the bank side, that is to say, she will know all formats, she will be responsible for producing the documentation in that format, and tracking this information in the STATE DB etc\n3) Nikita will check that the documentation is complete for both sides of the process. This means referencing loan type against the documents required for that loan from the various supported lenders, and storing this information in a DB so that Francis can get it from the customer\n",
        "height": 816,
        "width": 896,
        "color": 4
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        4320,
        2656
      ],
      "id": "06b2a41e-14f0-49cf-bdb7-303d24010163",
      "name": "Sticky Note12"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "KESHA TASKS\n1) Kesha deals with Credit. Expects to find information in her DB, and will not work without it. When she receives the loan requirement, and all relevant data from the DB (put there by Nikita) she first verifies that everything needed is there. Then updates a docs verified by Kesha column\n2) Kesha uses the CAM and queries the documents for any information. She provides a recommendation, a reason for the recommendation, and a report for the customer with actionable steps (how to improve credit) and provides questions for Francis to ask (understand customer better) \n3) Kesha provides an estimate of what lender is likely to do the transaction - and a recommendation basis commission\n4) ",
        "height": 816,
        "width": 896,
        "color": 4
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        5392,
        2656
      ],
      "id": "af09d1fa-998f-491a-900a-9b6d7bdcb336",
      "name": "Sticky Note13"
    }
